    "body": "@wmmiii are you aware that you can send break signals of arbitrary lengths using the `setSignals()` function (see https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/SerialPort/setSignals)?\r\n\r\nUsing this function you can set break to true, wait a specified time (e.g. 200ms) then set break to false. I have used this approach with https://ninjaterm.mbedded.ninja/ and it seems to work well.",
